---
import { ShieldCheck } from '@phosphor-icons/react/dist/ssr';
---

<section class="py-14 sm:py-20 md:py-24 bg-background px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-14 items-center px-4 sm:px-8 md:px-10 lg:px-12">
        <div class="relative pb-8">
            <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-trayko-xl">
                <img
                    src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493160503554-640891d88a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
                    alt="Conductor sonriendo al volante durante un viaje por carretera"
                    class="w-full h-[260px] sm:h-[340px] object-cover"
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                />
            </div>
            <div class="absolute -bottom-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 lg:left-auto lg:right-6 lg:translate-x-0 glass-card px-4 py-3 min-w-[220px] shadow-trayko-md">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-700 inline-flex items-center justify-center">
                        <ShieldCheck size={16} weight="fill" />
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-on-surface leading-tight">Conductor verificado</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-tight">Perfil validado y reseñado</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-8 lg:pt-0">
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.05] mb-5">
                Conductores particulares comparten su ruta para ahorrar en combustible.
            </h2>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-7 max-w-xl">
                ¿Tienes espacios libres en tu vehiculo? No viajes solo. Publica tu ruta, elige tus pasajeros y recupera parte de los costos de forma segura y sencilla.
            </p>
            <a
                href="/conductores/"
                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-on-secondary-container px-8 min-h-[48px] font-bold hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
            >
                Comparte tu viaje
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
